---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";

import teamPic from "../assets/teams/decode_33.png";
import botPic from "../assets/media/robotics-42.jpg";
---

<Page>
    <div class="segment reverse">
        <img class="full" src={teamPic.src} alt="Team 33517 Robit Photo">
        <div class="segment-content">
            
            <h2>About <span class="keyword">Team 33517</span></h2>
            <p>
                <b>33517, Nighthawks New Horizons</b> is the newest member of the Nighthawks Robotics flock. Our dedicated members are currently composed of Grade 10 and 11 students, ready to embrace the legacy of Nighthawks Robotics during the Decode season.
            </p>
            <p>
                As a competitive team, New Horizons focuses on gaining and refining their skills with hands-on experience with robot design, programming, and teamwork. The team is actively contributing to the Nighthawks program and aiming to build a strong foundation for future members and competitions.
            </p>

            <h2>Goals & Future Plans</h2>
            <ul>
                <h3>Decode 2025-26</h3>
                <li>Design Award Runner-up @ Nii'miis'stii League Tournament</li>
                <li>Provide a supportive learning environment for new members</li>
                <li>Develop skills in programming, mechanical design, and team strategy</li>
                <li>Support their community through public events</li>
                <li>Further advance their technological expertise in the SETm fields</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="segment">
        <img src={botPic.src} alt="Team 33517 Robit Photo">
        <div class="segment-content">
            <h2>Mentorship & Growth</h2>
            <p>
                Team 33517 benefits from direct mentorship from <a href="/24124">Team 24124 North Star</a> members. Guidance is provided in robot design, programming, and competition strategy to help New Horizons members develop essential robotics skills.
            </p>
            <p>
                By participating in the Nighthawks Robotics ecosystem, Team 33517 fosters a collaborative learning environment. Members are encouraged to share knowledge and support each other, helping the team grow and succeed in FIRST competitions.
            </p>
            <p>
                New Horizons also works closely with other learning teams, providing opportunities to engage in mentorship and teamwork, strengthening the overall robotics community at North Trail High School.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <h1><b>Our Journey Into Robotics<b></h1>
    <div class="segment">
            <img src={botPic.src} alt="Team 33517 Robit Photo">
            <div class="segment-content">
                <h2>Early Season</h2>
                <p>
                    Team 33517 benefits from direct mentorship from <a href="/24124">Team 24124 North Star</a> members. Guidance is provided in robot design, programming, and competition strategy to help New Horizons members develop essential robotics skills.
                </p>
                <p>
                    By participating in the Nighthawks Robotics ecosystem, Team 33517 fosters a collaborative learning environment. Members are encouraged to share knowledge and support each other, helping the team grow and succeed in FIRST competitions.
                </p>
                <p>
                    New Horizons also works closely with other learning teams, providing opportunities to engage in mentorship and teamwork, strengthening the overall robotics community at North Trail High School.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
</Page>
